license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
abstract: |
  Metastyling treats identity as a complex adaptive system governed by measurable 
  dynamics, navigable through strategic reconfiguration, and modeled using principles 
  from dynamical systems theory, cognitive neuroscience, and machine learning. The 
  framework provides formal architecture (DMES vectors, Faces as attractors, Levels 
  of Awareness), mathematical equations for state evolution and transition cost, and 
  practical protocols for personal development, organizational strategy, and AI character design.
